        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027342",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that one or more of our product candidates may qualify for some of these expedited development and review programs, as exemplified by the Fast Track designations granted for ACI-24.060, ACI-35.030 or PI-2620.",
        "start_character": 121478,
        "end_character": 121697
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027342",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027342-ba643ddc5651875b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027342",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We do not own or operate facilities for the manufacture, testing, packaging, labeling, storage or distribution of non-clinical or clinical supplies of any of our product candidates.",
        "start_character": 111478,
        "end_character": 111659
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027342",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027342-ba643ddc5651875b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027342",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We estimate that it generally takes 10 to 15 years, or possibly longer, to discover, develop and bring to market a new pharmaceutical or biopharmaceutical product in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 131580,
        "end_character": 131754
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027342",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027342-ba643ddc5651875b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027342",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We instead contract with and rely on third-party CMOs to manufacture, package, label, store, test and distribute all non-clinical and clinical supplies of our product candidates, and we plan to continue to do so for the foreseeable future.",
        "start_character": 111660,
        "end_character": 111899
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027342",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027342-ba643ddc5651875b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027342",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We may hold any future marketing authorizations granted for our product candidates in our own name, or appoint an affiliate or a collaboration partner to hold marketing authorizations on our behalf.",
        "start_character": 173084,
        "end_character": 173282
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027342",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027342-ba643ddc5651875b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027342",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Given these complexities, it becomes more important that we develop improved methods to fully characterize the underlying pathologies in different patients to ultimately provide better opportunities for therapeutic intervention at all stages of disease.",
        "start_character": 15246,
        "end_character": 15499
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027342",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027342-ba643ddc5651875b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027342",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Leveraging our Morphomer platform, we developed proprietary PET imaging agents for diseases resulting from the misfolding of a-syn and TDP-43 proteins.",
        "start_character": 31948,
        "end_character": 32099
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027342",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027342-ba643ddc5651875b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027342",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Morphomer Tau.We are researching and developing small molecule Tau aggregation inhibitors with plans to evaluate candidates in AD and potentially other tauopathies.",
        "start_character": 98724,
        "end_character": 98888
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027342",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027342-ba643ddc5651875b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027342",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The key aspect of both our SupraAntigen and Morphomer technology platforms is conformational specificity, which we believe is central to the development of effective and safe therapeutics for neurodegenerative diseases.",
        "start_character": 38186,
        "end_character": 38405
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-027342",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-027342-ba643ddc5651875b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-027342",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are advancing the clinical development of ACI-12589, the first molecule capable to detect pathological a-syn in the brain of patients with MSA and to differentiate them from controls (Figure 24), other synucleinopathies and more generally other neurodegenerative diseases.",
